From 75f1ca26a55caaf6f0f185c0bcfd2463c98fe9b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 13:26:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 03/18] irqchip: add SigmaStar SSD20xD GPI and MStar PM
 interrupt controllers

Add the SSD20xD GPIO interrupt controller (gpi), the MStar PM sleep
interrupt controller and the PM wakeup controller.

Taken from the final state of the linux-chenxing mstar_v6_7_rebase branch
(https://github.com/linux-chenxing/linux, Daniel Palmer et al.) and ported
to v7.3. Converted to irq_domain_create_linear(), and the
wakeup controller now checks request_irq().

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 drivers/irqchip/Kconfig                |  19 +++
 drivers/irqchip/Makefile               |   2 +
 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-intc.c   | 135 ++++++++++++++++
 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-wakeup.c | 145 +++++++++++++++++
 drivers/irqchip/irq-ssd20xd-gpi.c      | 211 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/soc/mstar/pmsleep.h            |  27 ++++
 6 files changed, 539 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-intc.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/irqchip/irq-msc313-pm-wakeup.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/irqchip/irq-ssd20xd-gpi.c
 create mode 100644 include/soc/mstar/pmsleep.h

